label 52
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 55
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
delay 60
text Even when it got late at night, I was still alone.
text I was huddled in the hallway, gripping the scissors.
text I was trying my best to think.
text If I kept my mind occupied by thinking of things, my fear felt farther away.
text Those adults were the bad guys.
text They tried to take away something important that belonged to my mother and father.
text Right now, I'm the only one at home.
text I'm not allowed to let strangers inside.
text That's why I have to protect my home.
text Until my mother and father return.
text Until Tomoya-kun comes to see me.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s53
fi
goto 53
label s53
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 53
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 55
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
delay 60
text My stomach growled again.
text I halved the remaining half of the apple pie.
text The pie was delicious, but I became hungrier after I finished eating.
text But I thought I should restrain myself.
text This was all that was left of my mother's cooking. If I ate a lot, it would all be gone.
text I thought to myself that I should always eat only half.
text Tomorrow morning, I would eat half. For lunch, half of that. For dinner, half of that.
text By doing that, I would never run out.
text That's why I would do halfsies forever.
text Halfsies with no one to share it with...
delay 60
text The hallway was chilly, so I took a blanket from the closet.
text I wrapped myself in it then picked up the scissors again.
text I was always in bed by this time.
text This was always the time when my mother would say good night to me while I lay in my warm bed.
text I became sleepy, but I tried my best to keep my eyes open.
text I thought that if I went to sleep, the bad guys would get into the house.
text Because I cried so much, my eyes stung and ached.
text I thought about turning the television on again, but I was too scared.
text I wondered what I would do if nothing showed on the screen.
text I wondered what I would do if everyone in the world was gone and I was the only one left.
text That was much, much scarier than the bad guys coming into my home.
text Why did this happen?
text Why did I end up all alone?
text I tried my best to think, but I didn't understand.
text I was very sleepy and I dozed off. Then I twitched and opened my eyes...
text I realized that I was crying again.
text My cheeks were wet and chilly...
text The floor was hard and cold and made my butt hurt.
text Even then I refused to let go of the scissors.
text I gripped them so hard that my knuckles were white.
text I only did that because I didn't know what else to do.
setvar strS[1000] = "SIRO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s54
fi
goto 54
label s54
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 54
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 55
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
delay 60
text It was a very, very long night.
text I think I only slept for a little while.
text When I opened my eyes, my cheek was resting against the floor of the hallway.
text I didn't know why I was there.
text Maybe it was all a dream.
text It was a very, very scary dream.
text The airplane my mother and father were on fell into the ocean...
text And lots of scary adults came, and Tomoya-kun didn't.
text I held the scissors to try to protect my home...
text That was all I could remember.
sound E1A.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I should go back to my room...
text As I got up, I felt something hit my toes.
text It was my mother's sewing scissors.
delay 60
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s55
fi
goto 55
label s55
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 55
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 0
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Tears welled up in my eyes.
text My vision blurred and my mind went black.
text It's a lie.
text This is all a lie.
text This is wrong.
text Everything is a lie.
text My mother and father are home.
text They're only hiding because I was a bad girl.
sound E.aac
sound E1B.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Mommy?
sound E1C.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Mommy, where are you?
text I looked for my mother.
sound 9.aac
sound E1D.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Mommy! Mommy! Mommy!
text I looked in the living room, the kitchen, the bath, the restroom, the closets, everywhere.
sound E.aac
sound E1E.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Mommy! Come out... Mommy, Mommy...
text And yet, I couldn't find my mother anywhere.
sound 0F.aac
text I ran up the stairs, step by step.
sound E1F.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Daddy... Daddy... Daddy!
text I looked in the bedroom, the guest room, the closets, everywhere.
text And yet, I couldn't find my father anywhere.
sound E.aac
sound E1G.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Daddy... *Hic* Daddy...
text Large droplets streaked my face.
sound 9.aac
sound E1H.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll be a good girl! *Hic* I'll be a good girl...
text I went through every room in the house while crying.
sound E.aac
sound E1I.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Mommy... Daddy... *Sniff* Please come out... Come out...
text I looked everywhere...
text But my mother and father would not come out.
text The only place left to check was my father's study.
text It was a special room that my mother told me to never go into.
sound A.aac
text I broke my promise and opened the door.
text I thought my father was hiding in there.
text I smelled the tobacco pipe.
text And I smelled the old books.
text I fumbled around looking for the switch and then turned on the lights.
setvar strS[1000] = "SIRO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s56
fi
goto 56
label s56
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 56
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
text The lights were a soft orange color and there was a thick carpet in the middle of the room.
text Many, many books lined the walls.
sound E1J.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Daddy?
text But my father was nowhere to be found.
text It was my father's room, but my father was missing.
sound E1K.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Daddy...
text I looked on top of the desk.
text I saw a black fountain pen, a square matchbox, a stack of white notepads, and...
text There was a clear glass cup, a green bottle of alcohol, and a few books...
text I also found a large brown envelope.
text I cautiously picked up the envelope.
text It was open and there appeared to be a book inside.
text I wanted to look inside, but I was too scared.
text This must be the "important thing" that the bad adults were after.
text It was something that would help everyone in the entire world.
text It was light, thin, and flimsy...
text It couldn't possibly be a replacement for my mother and father.
text This must be the reason why my mother and father were gone.
text Teardrops fell on the envelope.
text I hated it.
text That's how I sincerely felt.
text It was wrong for this thing to be so precious.
text I didn't care about the people of the world.
text I didn't care about the world itself.
text All I wanted was my mother and father.
text All I wanted was my mother and father to be here for me.
text And yet, they left me behind.
text Both of them had sunken into the ocean far away.
text I cried.
text While crying, I put the envelope on the carpet.
text Then I took the matchbox from the top of the desk.
text My father always used it to light his pipe.
text I took a match from the box.
text With trembling hands, I rubbed the match against the box...
text But I couldn't light it...
text I struck matches one after another until I got it right.
text And...
music ~
