text I leave that room.
text The heavy wooden door separates me and Kotomi.
text I'm left by myself in the darkness of the hall.
text @[Tomoya]
text See you tomorrow...
text My whispers are absorbed into the nothingness of the space.
text I didn't know it would be this painful...
text Saying "see you tomorrow" to someone who may never show up.
